// Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded hyperbolic cosine of F16
//
// x = x1 + x2 (see HypTables.tess) for |x|: cosh(x) = cosh(x1) cosh(x2) +
// sinh(x1) sinh(x2), from F32 tables, with one fused multiply-add fixing the
// order. Round to nearest only: overflow gives +inf, NaN gives NaN.
//
// Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binary16/cosh/coshf16.c via RazorForge's B16Cosh.rf.
// Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
// MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

